design_notes = "Matrix contract: Burst / Targetted / Object Manipulation. Polarize intentionally does not become another lightning damage spell. It establishes a reusable physical connection contract through receive_polarize_force, receive_polarize_link, and release_polarize_link hooks. Ordinary RigidBody3D props work immediately; authored mechanisms can opt in through the polarizable group or hooks."
